
<div class="googlereviews">
    <div class="googlereviews-item">
        <div class="reviewer-top">
            <div class="reviewer-info">
                    <div class="starholder">
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="review-title">So grateful for real <br>ergonomic support</h3>
                    <div class="review-body">
                        <p>I am a trained ergonomist and have recommended these chairs to clients when I was a rehab consultant for many years. I have an acute episode of backpain and it is such a relief to have a chair which is fully ergonomic.</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="reviewer-name">- Simonie</p>
                    {%comment%} END::timeago {%endcomment%}
            </div>
        </div>
        {%- if reviewno_counter_index == 1 -%}
            <p class="reviewer-review">{{ reviewdata.review | truncatewords: 23, "..." }}</p>
        {%-else-%}
            <p class="reviewer-review">{{ reviewdata.review | truncatewords: 23, "..." }}</p>
        {%-endif-%}
    </div>
    <div class="googlereviews-item">
        <div class="reviewer-top">
            <div class="reviewer-info">
                    <div class="starholder">
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="review-title">Still the best chair <br>option after 15 years</h3>
                    <div class="review-body">
                        <p>I've had a Gregory chair at work for the last 15 years and found it the most comfortable for my body shape. During the Covid lockdown I needed to find a work chair for home and was so happy to be able to find it at Gregory.</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="reviewer-name">- Christina Cassidy</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="googlereviews-item">
        <div class="reviewer-top">
            <div class="reviewer-info">
                    <div class="starholder">
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                        <div class="clip-star"></div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="review-title">Creative solutions <br>for creative minds</h3>
                    <div class="review-body">
                        <p>We have worked with jason.l across our office fitout, their ability to turn an empty room into a functioning and creative office space is second to none. Our creative team has now their ideal place to share and empower thereself together.</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="reviewer-name">- Alyssa Kriis, Salt Strong</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>